-Corollary~\ref{cor:collapsequot}, applied to $E/\langle w\rangle$ and
-its defect $D=D_{\mathrm{coll}}$, computes it from
-$\operatorname{Res}_{\mathrm{MF}}\bigl((E/\langle w\rangle)/D\bigr)$.
-These reductions give no further information about that last group:
-$w=1$ in $E/\langle w\rangle$, and the generators of $D$ are trivial
